  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T09:55:47.180245Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T10:04:01.198209Z",
  "totalBlocks": 14,
  "translatedBlocks": 14,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c343c61c54c9a4c",
      "translationZh": "大家一直搞不清楚这件事，所以我查看了 hf 上的 safetensors。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4309c6e940026f7c",
      "translationZh": "标题本该是“Deepseek V4.1 Flash 总参数量为 748B／基础模型参数量为 552B，而不是 284B、305B、485B 或 522B”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "50c1d48afaae77ee",
      "translationZh": "这个模型不是 284B。最初的 Deepseek V4 Flash 是 284B，但 V4.1 Flash 模型不是。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "842e54800171f038",
      "translationZh": "这个模型不是 305B，尽管有些人声称“所以：~305B 真正的主干网络 + 203B engram = 508B 总参数量”。这是不正确的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5e17b1ae91d21d2",
      "translationZh": "这个模型不是 485B，尽管 Huggingface 将其列为 485B，但那是因为他们把一些 FP4 打包权重按字节数而不是参数个数来计数了（每字节包含 2 个 FP4 参数）。这种情况经常发生；例如，Huggingface 在这里错误地认为 GLM-5.3-flash 是 169b。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1b42b7d2b7458a53",
      "translationZh": "这个模型不是 522B，尽管 VLLM 出于某种奇怪的原因将其列为 522B。他们在页面后面的内容中自行作了更正（在那个 vllm 页面上用 ctrl-f 搜索“Params”）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "05c5434e0b87d55c",
      "translationZh": "552B 是这个列表中唯一还算正确的数字；不过，它只包括基础模型，不包括 MTP、engrams 和视觉编码器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7834f2b3486bc1be",
      "translationZh": "准确地说，主模型有 40 层，参数量约为 551.566B。FFN 专家的参数量合计为 543.582B，模型的其余部分（注意力、共享专家等）为 7.984B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "332dbb661b95c9f8",
      "translationZh": "除此之外，engram 约为 ~196.929B，DSpark/MTP 约为 ~14.225B，而视觉编码器仅为 ~0.485B。不过，从技术上讲，这些部分都是可选的。视觉编码器也比我预想的小得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aee635e598e5bf02",
      "translationZh": "总之，你需要一套性能强劲的系统来运行它。128GB 或 256GB 的 RAM/VRAM 都不够用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fce565fa13cc707",
      "translationZh": "组件 逻辑参数量 大小（GB） 存储",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31546d85ca1517f0",
      "translationZh": "Engram 投影/门控",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2dad98d5e539121e",
      "translationZh": "196.929B = 宣传中的 196B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fd9148b5a9c8b02",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/DistanceSolar1449 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
